{"id":"581be47126558206","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Pure Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy — ZFC Game3 Pure Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy — ZFC Game3 Pure Strategy","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-game.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-pure-strategy — ZFC Game3 Pure Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-game.md\">../batch02/58-df-game.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(X\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> (move set) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(I\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> (player set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (set of legal finite histories over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-game.md\">../batch02/58-df-game.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq H\">\\(N\\subseteq H\\)</span> (terminal histories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:H\\setminus N\\to I\">\\(P:H\\setminus N\\to I\\)</span> (player-turn function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span> (player)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> (pure-strategy function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PureStrategy}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PureStrategy}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}pure\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3PureStrategy}_S(H,N,P,i,s,X,I)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land H\\subseteq\\{h\\mid\\mathrm{FinSeq}(h,X)\\}\\land\\varnothing\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\to h\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\land N=\\{h\\in H\\mid\\neg\\exists x\\in X\\;(h^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle\\in H)\\}\\land P:H\\setminus N\\to I\\land i\\in I\\land s:\\{h\\in H\\setminus N\\mid P(h)=i\\}\\to X\\land\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(h^\\frown\\langle s(h)\\rangle\\in H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}pure\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3PureStrategy}_S(H,N,P,i,s,X,I)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land H\\subseteq\\{h\\mid\\mathrm{FinSeq}(h,X)\\}\\land\\varnothing\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\to h\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\land N=\\{h\\in H\\mid\\neg\\exists x\\in X\\;(h^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle\\in H)\\}\\land P:H\\setminus N\\to I\\land i\\in I\\land s:\\{h\\in H\\setminus N\\mid P(h)=i\\}\\to X\\land\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(h^\\frown\\langle s(h)\\rangle\\in H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-game.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-game.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"targe